# The production picker opened for a line of the queue and closed the other ways: OK, a double click on a cell (which answers as the
# button for it does here), the right-click menu's first line, and Escape. See prodpicker_slot.scene for how it is opened.
# The leaders' portraits in the base screen animate on their own slow clock.
